                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Reminiscent of Sir Charles Spencer \\\"Charlie\\\" Chaplin (1889–1977), English comic actor and film director of the silent film era."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "220731fd-45d1-4f15-b4ff-6cb9bf274b89",
                                                "sense_id": "15093fbe-9fc3-39ea-8d10-5b5e0899cc90",
                                                "text": "One of these [posters], When in Doubt, Take the Underground (1913), depicts a dazed, Chaplinesque man consulting his watch and looking perplexed. Well, he would look perplexed - he hasn't yet noticed the light of the Underground station sign behind him."
                                            }
